epth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "`/api/decks` now leaves out decks with no matches and returns `first_played` for the rest. The date range in `versionDays` now starts from `first_played`, and falls back to `first_seen` when that is null.\n\nI delegated the work to the implementer subagent, read its diff, and re-ran the checks myself. All of them pass:\n- `uv run pytest -q tests/test_api.py`: 183 passed.\n- `uv run ruff check .`: clean.\n- `pnpm --dir web test`: passes. I only saw the tail of the output, so I didn't re-read the pass count. The implementer reported 496 passed.\n- `pnpm --dir web exec tsc -b`: clean.\n- `pnpm --dir web lint`: ran with no errors shown.\n- `pnpm --dir web gen:types`: the implementer ran it. I didn't re-run it, but `tsc -b` and the web tests pass against the regenerated types.\n\nI did not run the ingest, project and report check against a scratch database from `CLAUDE.md`, since the spec didn't list it. `SPEC.md` is still untracked and nothing is committed.", "ttft_ms": 1256, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 31225, "uuid": "b41a9251-5518-4e5f-8e29-c457d669a41a", "ttft_stream_ms": 911, "time_to_request_ms": 14, "first_content_frame_ms": 911, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
